   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hanging Aroud**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Further Up The Road**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Althea**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Whiskey In The Jar**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Cheap Tequila**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Cheap Sunglasses**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Breakdown**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Going Down The Road**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-05-12.akg481** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 197 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The show was billed as Billy Strings' Psychedelic Circus, with the Cris Jacobs Band on the bill [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-05-12.akg481**: taped by DavidPuddy; transferred by DavidPuddy; source: AKG 481 > MixPre 6 @ 24/48 [1]. Also: Recorded with an AKG 481 microphone into a MixPre 6 at 24-bit/48kHz; Transfer chain: MicroSD, Audacity (limiter, fades), CDWAV for tracking and FLAC, Foobar2000 for tagging, then LMA [1]",
